    "notes": [
      "Fix discard-all and file trash actions, show confirmation without loading per-file diffs, and discard directly without recovery snapshots. Staged changes are preserved.",
      "Add a repository toolbar Clean action for untracked files, automatic non-modal progress for foreground operations, and operation history with All, User, and Background filters.",
      "Keep staging failures visible after refresh, offer confirmed removal of an unchanged `index.lock` on lock-related failures, and preserve the index and staged changes.",
      "Restore action icons after busy animations and show repository operation progress on toolbar buttons.",
      "Show the failed Git command and its complete scrollable error output in Details, including launch failures and output arriving after the panel opens.",
      "Publish public package downloads through GitHub Releases, backfill retained releases from the authoritative Forgejo copies, and sign GitHub URLs into the website only after every mirrored asset has been downloaded and verified."
    ]
  },
